    <solution><m>( 0,4 )</m>, for instance, and identify the corresponding graph accordingly:
<me>\mathbf{F} ( x,y )= \left\lt  4 x+4,y \right&gt; \quad\Rightarrow\quad \mathbf{F} ( 0,4 )= \left\lt  4,4 \right&gt;\quad\Rightarrow\quad \text{Plot(3)}</me>



</solution>
